/// Receive messages from one or more Kinesis streams.
///
/// Consumes messages from one or more Kinesis streams either by automatically balancing
/// shards across other instances of this input, or by consuming shards listed explicitly.
/// The latest message sequence consumed by this input is stored within a
/// <<table-schema,DynamoDB table>>, which allows it to resume at the correct sequence of
